WEBVTT

00:00:03.483 --> 00:00:04.114
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:05.139 --> 00:00:09.075
<v><b>A1:</b></v> Hi, Kim. Do you want to come to the theater with me this Saturday?

00:00:09.365 --> 00:00:14.090
B1: Saturday? I can’t – it’s my brother’s 21st birthday!

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:17.096
We’re having a big party at my parents’ house.

00:00:17.842 --> 00:00:19.521
<v><b>A1:</b></v> Oh, that sounds great!

00:00:19.643 --> 00:00:23.388
Have a wonderful time – and say "happy birthday" from me!

00:00:25.292 --> 00:00:25.988
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:28.540 --> 00:00:30.557
<v><b>A2:</b></v> Are you in the office next week?

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:33.113
<v><b>B2:</b></v> No, I’m on vacation.

00:00:33.535 --> 00:00:34.513
<v><b>A2:</b></v> Where are you going?

00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:35.513
<v><b>B2:</b></v> Australia!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.713
<v><b>A2:</b></v> Lucky you!

00:00:37.048 --> 00:00:38.213
When do you get back?

00:00:38.296 --> 00:00:39.353
<v><b>B2:</b></v> On the 30th.

00:00:39.676 --> 00:00:41.837
<v><b>A2:</b></v> Wow! That’s a long vacation.

00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:43.720
<v><b>B2:</b></v> Yeah, three weeks!

00:00:43.762 --> 00:00:45.003
I can’t wait.

00:00:47.987 --> 00:00:48.693
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:52.211 --> 00:00:54.343
<v><b>A3:</b></v> You drink a lot of coffee!

00:00:54.761 --> 00:00:58.243
<v><b>B3:</b></v> Yes, this is my fifth this morning.

00:00:58.244 --> 00:01:00.017
<v><b>A3:</b></v> It’s not good for you, you know.

00:01:00.417 --> 00:01:04.050
<v><b>B3:</b></v> I know, but I can’t wake up without it.

00:01:10.042 --> 00:01:10.740
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:01:14.663 --> 00:01:15.957
<v><b>A4:</b></v> Where’s the restaurant?

00:01:16.231 --> 00:01:17.373
<v><b>B4:</b></v> It’s not far.

00:01:17.594 --> 00:01:21.240
It’s on the corner of Park Avenue and 53rd.

00:01:21.575 --> 00:01:24.607
<v><b>A4:</b></v> Great. See you there at 7:30.

00:01:28.692 --> 00:01:29.480
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.780
<v><b>A5:</b></v> Good morning. I’m here to see Maria Diaz.

00:01:35.127 --> 00:01:36.947
My name’s Brian Sanders.

00:01:37.081 --> 00:01:39.146
<v><b>B5:</b></v> Just a moment, sir, I’ll call her…

00:01:41.896 --> 00:01:45.346
Hi, Maria. There’s a Mr. Sanders here to see you…

00:01:46.913 --> 00:01:49.313
OK, sir. Could you sign in here?

00:01:49.846 --> 00:01:53.743
Great. You can go right up. She’s on the sixth floor.

00:01:53.959 --> 00:01:55.788
The elevators are over there.

00:01:56.009 --> 00:01:56.704
<v><b>A5:</b></v> Thank you.